              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Mulatschak is a traditional trick-taking card game using 36-card William Tell pack for 2-5, best with 3-4 players. It is a Rams-family plain-trick game with the Weli as permanent second-highest trump."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Mulatschak is treated as a distinct traditional card game because the source identifies its own player count, pack, rank order, and trick-play objective rather than only listing it as a synonym."
            }
          ]
        },
